EAAEAI_rer = EAA_rer/EAI_rer;
// Auxiliary equation for steady-state output
//Terms of Trade
EAAEAI_tot = EAI_pex*EAAEAI_rer/EAA_pex;
// Optimal price contract set in foreign markets (FOC), using EAA_pxtilde = EAJ_pimtilde
