)
+RW_size/EAH_size*RWEAH_im/EAH_ex*EAHEAA_rer*EAA_pex*RWEAA_im/(EAHRW_rer*RW_py*RW_y
+EAHEAA_rer*EAA_pex*RWEAA_im
+EAHEAB_rer*EAB_pex*RWEAB_im
